REM PLAINMS: plain manuscript text that keeps in a WordStar file: em
REM dashes become two hyphens, ellipsis characters three periods, and
REM curly quotes straight ones, in the whole document.
Sub MAIN
AutoRestore(ON)
Insert(ON)
Key("^QA—{Enter}--{Enter}ng{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
Key("^QA…{Enter}...{Enter}ng{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
Key("^QA“{Enter}""{Enter}ng{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
Key("^QA”{Enter}""{Enter}ng{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
Key("^QA‘{Enter}'{Enter}ng{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
Key("^QA’{Enter}'{Enter}ng{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
End IfException
End Sub
